{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:9195939249b631e44050e1ad391c945b80e5a9a6c517d92fdb384cb11a2cfdfe",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3003942f4d279ffcac6e9157ec4b44d516fe06a1a8b9817096c20f28590f3a27",
      "text": "昭示的前路",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cea5846d169872c0e44c57e758c367f85ce8ec065835e9b18703d315ab788a3",
      "text": "苦恼的享介迟迟得不出答案。就在此时，\n悠介偶然在医院遇见了制作人，\n并收到了希望能面谈的提议。\n虽感困惑，但为了自己，也为了享介，\n悠介答应了对方的邀约。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_a:cmd-000014:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_a:cmd-000014:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3003942f4d279ffcac6e9157ec4b44d516fe06a1a8b9817096c20f28590f3a27",
      "text": "昭示的前路",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d879a43f5a9358b43299c979282e9a1489bfef5fcf4b54dbd3452d4eff386346",
      "text": "今天就是公布悠介缺阵消息的日子了吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed74b6b5190ab49049f96bec75aaae7eb2146291ae2c99bc43f5bcc863869947",
      "text": "（虽然想去参加球队练习，\n或者去悠介那边……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40dd58d71a4a373f32fbff0a21c429931d89893752623ff002c0ccfb8048cc41",
      "text": "享介。外面肯定会很吵闹，\n今天就别去练习了。记者那边由我们来应付。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15de148aa01347aff8fc8a78ef6eda765585a30608c82937a31fd5e2cc8c364b",
      "text": "公布我缺阵之后，医院周围可能会有\n记者过来。所以明天就别来探病啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:326f7fa69be340ecfc8378daefc8c2c3f33e1cff12c9a2113d5c3bc78505bffa",
      "text": "……这也是当然的。\n记者不可能不来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_a:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c923b9ad95bf07682114bcd1cb67e0f55fe9cdcf3306fd6a28dea40973960077",
      "text": "虽说是无可奈何，\n但这种时候真希望他们能让我们静一静啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_a:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ff3bf4735d000da3d425868eb4f6b26f9ee4dcc2fa01355e2fd36fc29070058",
      "text": "（悠介一定会说没关系的吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_a:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a66b3313cd5a37f29cbcb01f74bfc643d5c3f760c1b907d04bfa3dedc47b62c",
      "text": "（但就算是悠介，一直被问到\n受伤的事，也肯定会难受的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_a:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2364dde7b31e7adac5aef334b33d27db19ec06c1b9e146bfc66007f032ccaa5a",
      "text": "唉，不行啊。\n待着不动就净胡思乱想。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_a:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cc4f723e150569460bcf31a0c632357707b04c0c1c28f080eec860b2f87488c",
      "text": "去哪里跑跑步吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_b:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d349cec7098b390919450d21d3803ef255b0083a2d80b463c18cef51a4c0bf4e",
      "text": "这里是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea4349c07480f72a65900d8b1da8f989e6d869eeff0271e38e670edec13c7f42",
      "text": "（真怀念啊。\n以前也经常来这里和悠介一起练习呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b6e57661dffea0ea1fc24cb78033d140280771d7175b2a4569b21508d99879e",
      "text": "（两个人比赛颠球，\n或者一直研究必杀技直到太阳落山）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9485ef892b622387a211a73b20ec537b3df2c360f18a0de40d1db49c81f813f5",
      "text": "悠介……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a00d3aa1517050e45ceac99fedcd8f5fde7dd1aebba53a6d495f0c805019b1e5",
      "text": "缺阵的事，差不多也快正式公布了吧，\n报道出来了吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:636f9b34b8a65af8947413c1e8a42dad21a2f68625a8821087044a44401fad3b",
      "text": "“苍井悠介选手缺阵！复出短期内无望？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:668c8e07ee0d2231756007550aff02665a4c4e0720a176d0559abf7c1d23e7c0",
      "text": "“看了比赛，那伤势感觉已经不行了吧……”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b8acfc8623acc83bc4b8b5e40265f1b8e05e6fbdbbe23d01248bfe1b0632bf7",
      "text": "“前阵子状态好像就很差了。没调整好？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_b:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f73fc0fbd7568106b094acb9bb5322141642eb33f56419e0fa0840d63bf40770",
      "text": "“是不是教练让他上场太多了啊”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_b:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a7ff919ffd0fce7c39834d863f689957e8303152af6b7ef15aa185de51d975e",
      "text": "（不对，根本不是那样。\n教练和悠介都没有错！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_b:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbef3188550e5351a1f269003c23bf1850a467141f701eefe74a20b57dd75dc2",
      "text": "（悠介变成这样，都是因为我……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_c:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b18bce9f0cdfaf856a78cf51e61c127e96301aa64858a90020f11db1670f51fb",
      "text": "传球传球，这边这边！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_c:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b41bdbac24e0581772acac6afa461022be117814d99803b4ab0c430c255e02d9",
      "text": "哇，好臭，\n完全没踢进球门嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d73979c1fdde5efc7f70befab2a78fa41aef209399ec8ee1de50f43005c5b2f",
      "text": "啊哈哈，看我的看我的——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7f878b8ced1a7957c560d573e30ddbbc1696e38c370513aacbbf4bff12e7f43",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf83dbc0a892df46776f2862cfc58728556778fc98056efab146f31cd4b597d7",
      "text": "（是附近的孩子们啊，看起来真开心）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c70018cb2ccc056b23c6fcc69bb2926e21d377302185680a11f3bc0635a1a7f2",
      "text": "（不久前的我们，好像也是那样的呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26117f644f7fed4fb77a5872c523db9f7baf15a9cd0ea2d438e977353e56d8ca",
      "text": "（什么复杂的事都不用去想，整整一天，\n只是一心一意地追着球跑）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a5cccbeb3a417e64ebab29e3192427bd4fd25867b4aa0bc140e71f9c7b85ab7",
      "text": "（只要有悠介在，只要有足球在，那就足够了。\n其他什么都不需要）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_c:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2fc103eadcb080b46775df21c55bf9a44f3cc278771c9e143bd574c70b36bd0",
      "text": "（……不）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e791a25709c67742b6f61b772330dc7eb336ed92edb22937d9fdea6e5c9b8d19",
      "text": "（就算到了现在……我其实也什么都不需要）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f8a63082f6042bbf63b5c7062bfeee0e9d1456d567d7b4cd96201e9bb6c1d64",
      "text": "（我需要悠介。\n没有他的话，一切都没有意义）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51b23e52af3ede369e62e164084fae32abf0545e85195c7d7d4d03ec5af725a3",
      "text": "（但是，当时之所以没能向教练说出口……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_d:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbeb1116448c704bebd31a7b4323515abca45cee1f553b4798c888b5afec3392",
      "text": "（自由自在、随心所欲，对想做的事勇往直前。\n对必须去配合这样的悠介的现状……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e262f8ec138624ac3c7d4ad0430688a5a89e627e8f5bfa8084b140578930152",
      "text": "（其实内心深处……也是有所不满的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c1534b8f27a76db2b79cf97df33f477a8b91b9306f1126e599f07733c260ea0",
      "text": "我真蠢啊。\n明明一个人什么都做不到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32e40fe44aa39844949547c36ceb6311491d6683c6d02049611dfcbea3c08bb4",
      "text": "就因为我哪怕有过那么一点点的动摇……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5707261073b22717c4519dd747af89f5362e0e43b94b1ad6cc45fc95af85f005",
      "text": "……足球？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81f432415f01929e2fda5d5401f72521a72c78e0df85b141411927dc929b5b97",
      "text": "不好意思——！可以帮忙捡一下吗——？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_d:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bbb26345926db774d60485605eb398e4a64cc9eb9828da847eec4ecfaf7a39b",
      "text": "（是那些孩子的吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_d:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b188264fdf08d970655852826ab70879207339fbd04d795196d3640a6a670d5d",
      "text": "给，没事吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_d:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b46480b22b7c06a8935591d7db4a9a73b87237860fde6f8450c592e996fa7dc5",
      "text": "谢谢！……呃，诶，咦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_d:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77542aa948ecfc7c3c2fc9f10ba98179bfebe62a4cb7280cc53b1c7db610923b",
      "text": "嗯？怎么了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_e:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d5a0f0e1a83d041c1302ef84a412be85d87ef41a7f3dc257ade34eb7eb36af8",
      "text": "难道说，你是苍井享介选手吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_e:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa3339262dfa5b04d42fb8c983bef133eb9fa433f22f137547ed92aef4202f79",
      "text": "是我……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c94d37cd1700d755a897008abb2de4edd0f2ec54542ac2565de618e089aaad1",
      "text": "诶？真的耶！是真正的苍井选手！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_e:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9abd3bd09195f46edaf05df440c47c11f7c77caced2a3cc3418eaff271f85f00",
      "text": "为什么会在这里啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_e:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa677498108fbd5297cbf6e75fdcf4d1373ff872a7183a41e4f1690283019fa5",
      "text": "我一直有看你的比赛！\n最喜欢你和悠介选手的配合了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfe301122d9b4e6608c4f1102e752270735083ca4d35c781cb3bf7a2b8d75e91",
      "text": "必杀技超级帅气！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b22932c1edbee684681675a2f41ebdc8a74e7307209476c74f80b6291c7c363",
      "text": "我们的梦想，就是成为像苍井兄弟那样的\n职业足球选手！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f13cac81205e4c52b1da39700c70205a217eb856d987e0371bbe8fe32217b66e",
      "text": "……谢谢你们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_e:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0fc7bd4113c00fad1f620001150fe6f1ab1bdc40a85e00dcff231ed7558dc9c1",
      "text": "（可是我，根本不配成为被憧憬的对象）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98eab1a5b36e7fe76435fc46aabf74120ed0c6cdd2d81e8a1ef568a63bb4ab25",
      "text": "（剥夺了悠介的足球……\n甚至，连自己的足球也失去了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_f:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:048557fc73d2b59665f41fa4f9e374ab0f11d3e4550bdf65340a568d03f9cd2a",
      "text": "一周后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_f:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:732d3a276898b7077d04fbd5b1472f685e370cba792fd77cd13beef44b918e66",
      "text": "（今天是公司的体检啊。\n虽然是按贤君指定的地点来的，但这家医院真大啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_f:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c18b029513034429e45d7797cad49d2ab831a059b25ed5154a2bf5af982a7f1",
      "text": "（啊，有便利店。在去挂号之前\n先去买点东西吧……嗯，在那边的是）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_f:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:069508ec6cb1fd306e843f5717347c6151c042cbde9790875d21572e98c27d6c",
      "text": "阿姨，你好！\n有新点心上架了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_f:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d88f72c9f93fb0041bfbda844397da0529e4944e5291f837d61e4344ce497138",
      "text": "有哦，特意给悠介酱留着呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_f:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81e8f01bf782422d4c73c3ec691f490ddd829affe92a40fa2359293dfb7cd7ec",
      "text": "太好啦！谢谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_f:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4449e2284183a5f753e946f7088622844114c311da9e3c99f107826045f9088b",
      "text": "悠介君。你托我们买的足球杂志到了哦。\n待会儿能来护士站拿一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_f:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d42ae2a4a1275831896216b6ae50de37b29bde889bced8be5b0bca2a9d30d7bc",
      "text": "诶，真的吗？太感谢了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_f:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4952a2b91e2d85d21d39499a8a97979c437cc9c474d4b03ccfafc95ad0d94a67",
      "text": "啊，是悠介大哥哥！\n下次再教我踢足球哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_f:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11a1a7313e536ebc848f880cfec95acbd7ca78494137e8d04915bfa620d8d8d4",
      "text": "没问题，随时都行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_f:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cab9fee991e8b3f61c10efa15791fc7a83dc10f249ea9dd28603ff08ba839c0",
      "text": "（那个人好厉害。\n每个路过的人都在和他打招呼）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_f:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afdadc4bd47179cc62ef4eb0c12423bcf5723a7abf4c54c5d94e9948075b5fe2",
      "text": "（咦，不过难道说，那个人是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_g:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce5b872d02d8fbfc2f036033f07a3174346e57bfca949f19cac5de065fc74c1c",
      "text": "（果然没错。\n是苍井兄弟里的哥哥，苍井悠介先生！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_g:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b883d31a9b39da61261b736f28ac7a8a943992197d50cfc4120a24b12c545c65",
      "text": "（听说他因为受伤正在住院，\n原来就是在这家医院吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_g:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ece0f3e943ec31e73b428d9ca836a5b1c36742d91191b79dde6c9a5cd3e8bc33",
      "text": "好嘞，待会儿享介来了，\n大家一起踢足球吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_g:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46d84d2ca206aed809a0cb86f16110af32e18e07107b93d51af99ecea84fd3aa",
      "text": "就算第一次踢也没关系。\n我会教你诀窍的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_g:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae656aa468a4d9a0a42627d1fc99fbb94f0fd973f5110653a6976c2dbf8993b1",
      "text": "（好厉害，比在电视和杂志上看到的还要耀眼）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_g:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bec23e0abbb0a5e3317a8973bd9b5a9dc21b9013785620f79ab5782d950abf4",
      "text": "（很久以前就觉得他是一位非常有魅力的人，\n果然，好想邀请他来当偶像！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_g:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be879ada85ca461eb84878c2d6a2888734963bbb8b5c5c36a81bca0212c26db8",
      "text": "那我差不多该去准备康复训练了。\n待会儿见啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_g:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c0587106ea9288868d7ce5af296b5343e4a84c327ba910b8ec4915dcbc0ef35",
      "text": "（……好，至少先把名片\n交给他吧！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_g:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:037f11eda0cac90b6ef7a765ae5539f70103bcc9fbfed5a6cc42c44e2eb32467",
      "text": "那个，不好意思打扰一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_g:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e709e021d7237a319fac6b64252e79120d39b016f2b1d14b6e744f09572fb3f",
      "text": "怎么了？嗯，在叫我吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_g:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f7abecd9c7654dc362c680e40650387b1e37684bf6462487d1491c9b84ef802",
      "text": "是的。您是苍井悠介先生对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_h:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a220f0b41e98f7103a1fb2735d2f32fd79dc95f6a682d5e508b1a2a49a07af8e",
      "text": "是啊。\n那个，我们在哪里见过吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_h:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:612ed3cbaf2ebb8b45eaec8dceeee4093d756179242a95bfea1d4c8b7a3f55ac",
      "text": "看起来不像是我的粉丝，\n也不像是记者呢……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_h:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cad312b80f98b8f8a5d2caf5fa6339f1623418bb4ffe1ed552bc61dec6d45e6b",
      "text": "失礼了，请容我向您做个自我介绍。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_h:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:332947fe4c29158702215a85e74942f37ef00d984b421a77613daa558d858f1d",
      "text": "我在一家名叫315 Production的事务所，\n担任偶像制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_h:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:988c1fc6792f0877922573d8b76f9788526697918b6da81ec8b0fe30668112a4",
      "text": "如果可以的话，能收下这张名片吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_h:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e7696fc186c4df02fdd948cc982d5569f4ea2ba96f249add36a612b0adae9a4",
      "text": "这个是……名片？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_h:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d1269cd6beba96ce1d0a307d261cb96b2a75e468b811ea960f1ab898ec79b8d",
      "text": "其实很久以前我就希望能和苍井悠介先生、享介先生\n好好聊一聊了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_h:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73a60df33cc99f44bf3f7ccc6cb326ed24791bdf4256c78c6532285e0aeaa7a3",
      "text": "我在两位身上感受到了成为偶像的天赋。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_h:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02f2a1900852cf43ce2df980813c0c08382659658a3c3df8c2625b5b292a9e24",
      "text": "成为偶像的，天赋？……我们吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_h:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be56dd785be60c22db143e2fc5f328c939d757993585507245ce33d5f78c7901",
      "text": "是的。关于这件事，\n不知改天能否找个地方和您详谈呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_i:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7063ef0e54b9d140b29e48f6182dfb0615ec4b23c46a66b051f102dee744f11e",
      "text": "诶、那个，聊聊是没问题啦。\n不过等下我有康复训练。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_i:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3e14ddd36bc4d1ab30bc1b996512677463f32792721ad5e002293dee9621377",
      "text": "在那之前的话……不对，\n等康复训练结束之后时间更充裕吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_i:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a01826d6a94690acfc88b74c837ebfce19222ca02bae5e26e67fd13f75e952bf",
      "text": "话说回来，我们去当偶像……\n是真的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_i:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e36a63ad3672ffa7433b237f2e5eece145e4b9c14c41f1224a06fba4f167246e",
      "text": "是的，当然是真的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_i:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b96810bdcabaacc5d91ab2f8866940a63004ecdfa179a5ee177b86b611900973",
      "text": "不过非常抱歉，\n其实我接下来也刚好有别的安排。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_i:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ed3aa7253e843eaae3bfb4fa76c0adbac61897924540a469f5418c79b61ea98",
      "text": "因此，不知改日我再登门拜访是否可以呢？\n现在哪怕您只收下名片，我就很高兴了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_i:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09dd5d5f0e82f328cc2ff1008648becd31e2a1ca086f64cd9b3edce74ef3e16f",
      "text": "啊，嗯！\n……不对，好的，没问题！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_i:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2995961a81be5255e66eeb9de1c55c32d1980f25ca0fba0b99bdff0d93312d0a",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n那么，我就先告辞了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_i:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4682e397ce867a3ee7d34c8bbefd5de7b0d20023f54663dbd2dd5e377e17f595",
      "text": "……吓了我一跳。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_i:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78169263732afa7c398974298b65c76ec001bc82cbb254d01234ff61c12553e4",
      "text": "这种时候如果享介在的话，\n肯定能应付得更周全吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_i:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec2bfcf2b80a92c85449c492f0358c5747233c949df01dc6f0edab1b39fb6f17",
      "text": "（不过，感觉是个挺有意思的人呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_j:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:218adb8b9243432264a004ac12d91cb174cfa7751cb037ee177eb71b39235a95",
      "text": "（事情太突然了，完全还没搞懂是怎么回事……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_j:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3dfbd600f0d20948fbb6417e0b4af80c6ea537423cb2c0888d495e5e28137a76",
      "text": "（说我们有当偶像的天赋，吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_j:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46a7a85e897723b13dfd3d35a335f1abaf9c5ed3c2ab171b2e2e905785d97b66",
      "text": "偶像就是那个吧。\n唱歌、跳舞，还有主持之类的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_j:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ee6e3e334b712cb63215c674004922a104ea06d3563601807a8d811355f16ea",
      "text": "以前上电视工作的时候，\n虽然见过几次……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_j:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e04029a186a83303a8a2f233ca9ac2aab44500dd27582696b0327b066e19342f",
      "text": "（只记得他们整个人都在闪闪发光）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_j:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f17f1207f6488a1f39a4a1e1a48bc795cd363444285d7bcee1c32e11306078ef",
      "text": "（我们也要去当那种人吗？\n唔——完全想象不出来。……不过……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_j:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a9add43bac217d0db6058c5c8ce607b5602e60fce311504d45cdff1b62f066a",
      "text": "那个人说，想和享介也聊聊。\n说我们“两个人”都有天赋。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_j:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eaa48b2c20248d12265c86023ea50e413066c953ebc479165703a4333cbddb75",
      "text": "如果能和享介两个人再次……\n一起做点什么的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_j:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbe9c3979d095f79a9b535755084e0f0669044c6940d05a6e27930d2e2d57e84",
      "text": "（……说不定能让他振作起来！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_02_1_1_005_02:1_1_005_02_j:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
